When active, Browser VPN can protect eligible web browsing traffic in Floorp. Its scope does not include your operating system or other apps. This feature uses a Mozilla account and Mozilla service infrastructure. Floorp is an independent project and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Mozilla. Availability depends on your region, account status, and Mozilla’s service eligibility requirements.



Get started



















